SUPABASE_URL=your-supabase-url
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-maps-api-key

# Copy this file to `assets/.env` (NOT the project root) and replace the
# values with the ones from your Supabase project: Project Settings → API
# for SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, and Google Cloud Console for
# MAPS_API_KEY. assets/.env is what the app actually loads at startup
# (see lib/core/supabase_service.dart) and is bundled as a Flutter asset.